{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive into the enchanting world of &quot;Secret Cats - Zoo&quot; a hidden object game where your mission is to uncover every cat hidden within stunning hand-painted artwork. Let your keen eye and curiosity guide you through this captivating journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a 100 Hidden Cats: Discover 100 hidden cats scattered throughout the artwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Unlimited Hints: Stuck? Use unlimited hints to find the hidden cats and keep progressing.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Custom Music: Enjoy unique background music for the artwork, enhancing your immersion. <br>\ud83d\udd52 Timer: Keep track of how long you take to complete the level with an in-game timer. <br>\ud83c\udfc5 Leaderboard: Track your best times and challenge yourself to beat them.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the scenes using your mouse to drag and move, and zoom in/out with your mouse wheel. Click on any cat you find to collect it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Accessibility Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Mode for comfortable viewing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in &quot;Secret Cats - Zoo&quot; and indulge in the perfect blend of challenge, charm, and discovery. Will you find all the hidden cats? Let the hunt begin!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tigra Whiskers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170830/4a51a432da7638a6a82299978f3c0069799f9ec5.jpg"},{"name":"Flamingo-claw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170830/3d542a43803925cafc50ad0ec1bbb6b03e56eab1.jpg"},{"name":"Lynxie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3170830/7ecba4870ec36d8e6afbadc9f341e8fae716cfe3.jpg"},{"name":"Panth